   "text": "Thanks, Owen. Your identity is verified.\n\nI checked order 7601 from Pho Real. The courier handed it off at 6:41 PM, and the order shows 2 beef pho ($15.00 each), 1 spring rolls, and 1 banh mi. Since you're reporting one beef pho missing, you're eligible for compensation for that one item. Because your order used the WELCOME10 promo, the refund is adjusted slightly. You have two options:\n\n1. **Refund to your Visa ending 4242:** $12.00. This is the $15.00 item price minus its $3.00 share of the promo discount.\n2. **Account credit:** $18.00. This is the $15.00 item price plus 20%, usable on future orders.\n\nWhich would you prefer?"
