   "text": "The welcome code took **$10.00** off your order. Your subtotal was $50.00, so the discount was 20% of the total.\n\nEach beef pho was $15.00. Its share of the discount is $15 \u00d7 ($10 \u00f7 $50) = $3.00. That leaves $12.00 that you actually paid for that item, which is the amount I refunded.\n\nI've issued a **$12.00 refund** to your Visa ending 4242 (refund ID RF-4000). It should arrive in 3 to 5 business days.\n\nIs there anything else I can help with on this order?"
